n/math-academy-id "q-71227" :question/problem "Find ${(u(t)f(t))}^{′}$ where $f(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} \\\\ {e}^{4t} \\\\ {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]$ and $u(t)=t.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the scalar function multiple rule, we can write\n\n$$\n{(u(t)f(t))}^{′}={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${f}^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{3t}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{4t}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{5t})\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{3t} \\\\ 4{e}^{4t} \\\\ 5{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u(t)f(t))}^{′} & ={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =1\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} \\\\ {e}^{4t} \\\\ {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{3t} \\\\ 4{e}^{4t} \\\\ 5{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} \\\\ {e}^{4t} \\\\ {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3t{e}^{3t} \\\\ 4t{e}^{4t} \\\\ 5t{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(3t+1){e}^{3t} \\\\ (4t+1){e}^{4t} \\\\ (5t+1){e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71227/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b19f5f01-948e-5f44-8016-63073ed31dbc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71227"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71225/selection/455b985a7dad1dd75b52f633383c17a569c4f5d51ec2a6c4c3efc9bd55f24c5a" :answer/id #uuid "14784451-5ea7-55a7-b322-97172ecb01e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}8t-14 \\\\ 6t-5 \\\\ 10t-3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71225/selection/6428ae88aa2f93e5f20ed3517de29c5fd7d7c55ca809c45abb14d9b4b6ae95a0" :answer/id #uuid "a372e0b5-6844-5cdf-a406-2261db425471" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4t